 foundation doesn't make every integration private","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"A private foundation doesn't make every integration private","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"7dOL6y8uYfqTCjMxnpYUZ","type":"text","x":1592.0,"y":7046.25,"width":1872.11,"height":37.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["HVGuZGVBp-bijX_8TE1B6"],"frameId":null,"index":"bF9","roundness":null,"seed":577239544,"version":2,"versionNonce":541925485,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Teams and M365 Copilot publication uses a manually enabled, source-IP-filtered public Activity endpoint: not private end to end, so don't use it if public agent ingress is prohibited. Copilot Studio uses a delegated Power Platform private-network path (no\nActivity exception). Search to source and model private ingestion needs Search shared private links and owner approval. Peering alone doesn't propagate DNS: hub integration needs agreement on reverse peering, routes, DNS and gateway transit.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Teams and M365 Copilot publication uses a manually enabled, source-IP-filtered public Activity endpoint: not private end to end, so don't use it if public agent ingress is prohibited. Copilot Studio uses a delegated Power Platform private-network path (no\nActivity exception). Search to source and model private ingestion needs Search shared private links and owner approval. Peering alone doesn't propagate DNS: hub integration needs agreement on reverse peering, routes, DNS and gateway transit.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"0iAroYFAgXPcO41E5WWCa","type":"text","x":1592.0,"y":7101.75,"width":237.84,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":